DEADMOON EXAMPLE -- NOT A PROVISIONED WIDEVINE DEVICE

Replace this placeholder with a real, provisioned Widevine device binary named:
  local_resources/device.wvd

Set in token.env:
  SPOTIFY_WVD_PATH=/usr/src/app/local_resources/device.wvd
  AMAZON_WVD_PATH=/usr/src/app/local_resources/device.wvd

The real .wvd file is binary and device-specific. Generate or export it with the
provisioning tooling for your authorized Amazon Music downloader. Do not rename
this text placeholder to device.wvd: it cannot authenticate or decrypt media.
Do not commit or distribute the real device.wvd file.
